				(size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom))
		(uuid "aec6edcb-130c-5300-8b37-59a8aead4263"))
	(text "about 3.95 V: no 3.9 V detector is in stock, and the 4.0 V TPS3840 would release only at about 4.2 V (200 mV hysteresis above 3.1 V)."
