	(text "U5 ADS1115 (0x48): AIN0 = VCELL / 2 through Q9 (on only with 3V3); AIN1 = PROG through R24, Q11."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 261.62 223.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom))
		(uuid "5bf0c33b-84ed-53d1-8a00-87d885a16621"))
	(text "U6 PCA9536 (0x41): IO0 = INHIBIT, IO1 = FORCE (pulse), to block 4; 4.7k pull-downs there (U6 powers up with 100k pull-ups)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 261.62 226.06 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom))
		(uuid "a7961b02-cada-548e-a3d3-e259bded6436"))
	(text "With the CoreInk off, U5, U6 and Q9-Q11 are off: nothing from the cells, and no pin can"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 261.62 228.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom))
		(uuid "2258893a-d62c-5c45-82bb-a9bc660411a9"))
	(text "feed the unpowered CoreInk (FET gates, or nodes at 0 V). No I2C pull-ups: the CoreInk has them."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 261.62 231.14 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom))
		(uuid "f056c00d-4af6-5532-a5a8-50ea853fcb3d"))
	(text "Firmware: cells = 2 x AIN0; charge current = 60 mA x AIN1 / 0.91 V (R24/R23); FORCE starts a charge."
